r, maintenance, replacement, or other similar functions related directly to assets used by National Guard units while operating under state active duty status.</p>","updateDate":"2025-06-09T19:13:15Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Guarding Readiness Resources Act","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-07-23T23:06:26Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-07-23T23:06:26Z"}
